\section{Installation and Configuration}

\subsection{System Requirements}
The system is designed to run on standard LAMP/WAMP/XAMPP stacks with minimal dependencies:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Web Server:} Apache 2.4+ or Nginx
    \item \textbf{PHP:} Version 7.4 or higher (8.0+ recommended)
    \item \textbf{Required PHP Extensions:}
        \begin{itemize}
            \item \texttt{curl} - For HTTP requests
            \item \texttt{pdo\_sqlite} - For database operations
            \item \texttt{dom} - For HTML parsing
            \item \texttt{libxml} - For XML parsing
            \item \texttt{zip} - For bulk downloads
            \item \texttt{json} - For API communication
        \end{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Disk Space:} 50MB+ for application, additional space for database
    \item \textbf{Memory:} 128MB minimum, 256MB recommended
\end{itemize}

